#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.h1:5-17
msgid "Support Ceno"
msgstr "Dukung Ceno"

#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.p:6-17
msgid ""
"Ceno Browser is completely free and open source software funded solely "
"through grants and donations. Below are some of the ways you can support its "
"continued development through financial contributions. For other ways of "
"getting involved and contributing, please visit <a "
"href=\"community.html\">the Community page!</a>"
msgstr ""
"Ceno Browser adalah perangkat lunak bebas dan sumber terbuka yang sepenuhnya "
"didanai melalui hibah dan donasi. Berikut adalah beberapa cara Anda dapat "
"mendukung pengembangan berkelanjutannya melalui kontribusi finansial. Untuk "
"cara lain untuk berpartisipasi dan berkontribusi, silakan kunjungi <a "
"href=\"community.html\">halaman Komunitas!</a>"

#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.h2:12-25
msgid "Make a Donation"
msgstr "Berikan Donasi"

#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.p:13-25
msgid "Make a one-time donation using our Paypal payment portal."
msgstr "Lakukan donasi sekali saja melalui portal pembayaran PayPal kami."

#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.div:14-25
msgid "Donate via PayPal"
msgstr "Donasi melalui PayPal"

#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.h2:20-25
msgid "Become a Sponsor"
msgstr "Jadilah Sponsor"

#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.p:21-25
msgid "We are currently exploring fundraising platforms and communities:"
msgstr ""
"Saat ini kami sedang menjajaki platform penggalangan dana dan komunitas:"

#: donate.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.div:22-25
